<title>USA: Cellular Communications subscribers rise.</title>
<headline>Cellular Communications subscribers rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cellular Communications of Puerto Rico Inc said on Tuesday that it added about 11,000 subscribers in the third quarter.</p>
<p>The company said the number of its subscribers grew nearly 40 percent in the past 12 months to close to 150,000 subscribers.</p>
